│ severity in the mismatched group. Febrile patients receiving mismatched platelets tended to have a lower             │
│ posttransfusion increment increase than their nonfebrile counterparts (P = 0.068), although a similar trend could    │
│ not be demonstrated between febrile and nonfebrile patients who received matched platelets (P = 0.22). Patients      │
