{"study_index": 59, "title": "Prophylactic platelet administration during massive transfusion. A prospective,           
randomized, double‐blind clinical study", "abstract": "Prior studies at Harborview Medical Center have suggested that   
dilutional thrombocytopenia is a major etiology of microvascular, nonmechanical bleeding (MVB). We undertook a          
