│ "title": "Factors influencing moderate to severe reactions to PLT transfusions: experience of the TRAP multicenter   │
│ clinical trial.", "abstract": "BACKGROUND During the Trial to Reduce Alloimmunization to Platelets (TRAP Trial),     │
