│ x 10(9)/l and 2.3% (50/2147) of the study days when platelet counts were 10-20 x 10(9)/l. In patients with platelets │
│ > 20 x 10(9)/l, there were 117 major bleeding episodes observed on 5.4% of the study days. In patients with no       │
