there was any consumption factor. RESULTS The mean number (SD) of platelet transfusions during induction was 8.4 (5.3)  
in group A and 8.5 (5.5) in group B; and during consolidation 4.7 (3.4) in group A and 4.6 (3.8) in group B (p = n.s.). 
