children: results of a randomised prospective cross‐over trial of plasma removal and a prospective audit of WBC         
reduction", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Febrile nonhemolytic transfusion reactions (FNHTRs) complicate 2 to 37 percent of   
platelet transfusions in adults, but the incidence of such reactions in children is not known. The effectiveness of     
