│ on morbidity."}, {"study_index": 98, "title": "Therapeutic efficacy and safety of platelets treated with a           │
│ photochemical process for pathogen inactivation: the SPRINT Trial", "abstract": "We report a transfusion trial of    │
│ platelets photochemically treated for pathogen inactivation using the synthetic psoralen amotosalen HCl. Patients    │
