bleeding outcomes, CCIs are a validated surrogate marker for platelet transfusion efficacy in bleeding prevention. The 
population (hematologic malignancies on chemotherapy) and intervention (prophylactic platelet transfusions) match the 
review criteria.

--- Study 104: Efficacy of prophylactic transfusions using single donor apheresis platelets versus pooled platelet 
concentrates in AML/MDS patients receiving allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplantation ---
Decision: INCLUDE
